Subject: [PATCH 1/6] F635-3: CastIdSpecificBuff, refreshed from its own side
 and the same play (data 16.635.3)

Data 16.635.3 puts CastIdSpecificBuff in PlayerSpecificBuff's place on the evolved Firecracker's
fireworks and the evolved Cannon's barrage buff. An instance is refreshed only from its own side
and the same play: the play behind the source, by its king's count of card plays (the deploy
stamp crforge already keeps). A unit's shot reads its root's play; an impact's area effect, its
projectile's; a cast area effect, its cast's; a barrage's area effect, its cannon's, and the bomb
it drops keeps it. An area effect made any other way is refused for such a buff. Inferred from
the tables (b): per play and per side agree wherever one side has one such source alive.
Core tests: 16.402.22 2145/0; 16.635.3 (guard bypassed for the run) 16 -> 13 failures.
